    "title": "OPINION: 'Fall 2' a stressful experience - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Keaton Aldridge Jr. ,\n9 hours ago I have never been a big fan of heights. Even looking down from somewhere really high can make me uncomfortable, so watching “Fall 2: Deadpoint” already had something that could get a reaction out of me. The movie was released Sept. 2 and is a sequel to the 2022 movie “Fall.” It stars Harriet Slater as Jax Hunter and Arsema Thomas as Luce. The movie follows Jax as she travels to Thailand with Luce after the death of her sister. The two decide to climb Mount Kwan, but things go completely wrong when a rockslide leaves them trapped thousands of feet above the ground. From that point on, they are forced to find a way to survive while dealing with the fear of being that high up. Read full article",
